---
import type {CollectionEntry} from 'astro:content';
const {posts} = Astro.props as {posts:CollectionEntry<'posts'>[]};
---
<div class="post-list">{posts.length?posts.map(post=><a class="post" href={`/posts/${post.id}/`}><time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{post.data.date.toISOString().slice(0,10)}</time><div><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.description}</p><span class="tags">{post.data.tags.join(' / ')}</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>):<div class="empty"><p>这里还没有文章。</p><span>留白，等待下一次记录。</span></div>}</div>